```

A Simple View shows a selection only through a Data Pool: the pool marks the clicked roofs, the rows whose "interacted" column is "1".

Set the pool's selections between charts to MERGE_AND, so it keeps only the buildings both views select:

```json
{
  "nodeId": "ia-pool",
  "dataPool": {
    "betweenCharts": "MERGE_AND"
  }
}
```
